1 NOTE A small invented family, written to exercise every date shape GEDCOM
2 CONT can express. Everything AXGF records beyond this - confidence,
2 CONT non-family relationships, occupation spans, graded sources - is added
2 CONT after conversion, because GEDCOM has nowhere to put it. That contrast
2 CONT is the point of the demonstration.
